<section id="rabbitConfig" class="rb-shell rb-inline-rules" style="display:none;">
    <div class="gc-section-title">大白兔玩法规则 <span class="rb-scope">仅当前桌台</span></div>
    <p class="rb-caption">玩法规则仅应用到当前桌台；可分别设置不同倍率、权重和概率，修改后通过页面最底部的按钮与本桌参数一起保存。</p>
    <nav class="rb-nav" aria-label="规则分区"><a href="#rbAuthentic">正宗大四梅</a><a href="#rbFive">五枚赠送</a><a href="#rbStreak">连庄</a><a href="#rbOther">彩金</a></nav>
    <div class="rb-fields"><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbSmallFour">小四梅固定倍率</label><input type="number" id="rbSmallFour" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbReveal">特殊奖揭示超时（秒）</label><input type="number" id="rbReveal" min="1" max="120" step="1" /></div></div>
    <article id="rbAuthentic" class="rb-panel"><header class="rb-panel-title"><h3>正宗大四梅 · 翻倍档位</h3><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbAuthOn" /> 启用正宗翻倍</label></header><div class="rb-panel-body">
    <div class="rb-fields"><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbAuthBase">大四梅基础倍率</label><input type="number" id="rbAuthBase" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div></div>
    <div class="rb-edit-mode"><label for="rbAuthMode">配置方式</label><select id="rbAuthMode"><option value="weight">按权重</option><option value="probability">按概率（%）</option></select><span>权重自动换算概率；概率模式合计须为 100%。</span></div>
    <p class="rb-mini-note">无鬼大四梅按下表抽取倍数。奖励＝押分 × 基础倍率 × 抽中档位；关闭后只按基础倍率赔付。</p><div class="rb-table-wrap"><table id="rbAuthTable" class="rb-table"><thead><tr><th>翻倍档位（X1～X14）</th><th>相对权重</th><th>概率（%）</th><th>奖励倍数</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody><tfoot><tr><td>合计 / 加权平均</td><td class="rb-sum">—</td><td id="rbAuthProbSum">100.00%</td><td class="rb-avg">—</td><td></td></tr></tfoot></table></div><div class="rb-tools"><button type="button" id="rbAuthAdd" class="gc-newbtn">＋ 添加档位</button><span id="rbAuthSum"></span><span>最多 14 档，可添加、移除；权重为 0 不参与抽取</span></div>
    </div></article>
    <article id="rbFive" class="rb-panel"><header class="rb-panel-title"><h3>五枚赠送 · 中赠与落空</h3><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbFiveOn" /> 启用五枚赠送</label></header><div class="rb-panel-body"><div class="rb-fields"><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbFiveBase">五梅基础倍率</label><input type="number" id="rbFiveBase" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div><input type="hidden" id="rbFiveChanceN" /><input type="hidden" id="rbFiveChanceD" /><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbFiveForceN">强出中赠概率 <small>分子 / 分母</small></label><div class="rb-fraction"><input type="number" id="rbFiveForceN" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="强出中赠概率分子" /><span>/</span><input type="number" id="rbFiveForceD" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="强出中赠概率分母" /><output data-rb-pct></output></div></div></div><div class="rb-edit-mode"><label for="rbFiveMode">配置方式</label><select id="rbFiveMode"><option value="weight">按权重</option><option value="probability">按概率（%）</option></select><span>修改中赠或落空概率，另一项自动补足至 100%。</span></div>
    <div class="rb-table-wrap"><table class="rb-table" id="rbFiveResults"><thead><tr><th>自然结果</th><th>倍数档</th><th>相对权重</th><th>概率（%）</th><th>奖励倍数</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td>中赠</td><td><input type="number" id="rbFiveSuccess" min="1" max="255" step="1" aria-label="中赠倍数" /></td><td><input type="number" id="rbFiveWinWeight" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="中赠权重" /></td><td><input type="number" id="rbFiveWinPct" class="rb-percent" min="0" max="100" step="0.000001" aria-label="中赠概率百分比" readonly /></td><td id="rbFiveWinPay">—</td></tr>
    <tr><td>落空</td><td><input type="number" id="rbFiveMiss" min="1" max="255" step="1" aria-label="落空倍数" /></td><td><input type="number" id="rbFiveMissWeight" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="落空权重" /></td><td><input type="number" id="rbFiveMissPct" class="rb-percent" min="0" max="100" step="0.000001" aria-label="落空概率百分比" readonly /></td><td id="rbFiveMissPay">—</td></tr>
    </tbody><tfoot><tr><td>合计 / 加权平均</td><td></td><td id="rbFiveWeightSum">—</td><td id="rbFiveProbSum">100.00%</td><td id="rbFiveAveragePay">—</td></tr></tfoot></table></div><p class="rb-mini-note">自然期望按两档概率加权；强出概率只用于指定送五梅的场景。关闭赠送后，五梅仅按基础倍率赔付。</p></div></article>
    <article id="rbStreak" class="rb-panel"><header class="rb-panel-title"><h3>连庄 · 烧火送小四梅</h3><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbStreakOn" /> 启用连庄</label></header><div class="rb-panel-body"><div class="rb-fields"><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbBurn">烧火窗口（局）</label><input type="number" id="rbBurn" min="1" max="255" step="1" /></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbContribution">每局押分入池（万分点）</label><input type="number" id="rbContribution" min="0" max="10000" step="1" /></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbInitPool">初始奖池分</label><input type="number" id="rbInitPool" min="0" max="9007199254740991" step="1" /></div></div><div class="rb-table-wrap"><table id="rbStreakTable" class="rb-table"><thead><tr><th>送奖次数（1～255）</th><th>相对权重</th><th>抽中概率</th><th>奖励倍数</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody><tfoot><tr><td>合计 / 加权平均</td><td class="rb-sum">—</td><td>100.00%</td><td class="rb-avg">—</td><td></td></tr></tfoot></table></div><div class="rb-tools"><button type="button" id="rbStreakAdd" class="gc-newbtn">＋ 添加次数档</button><span id="rbStreakSum"></span></div><p class="rb-mini-note">奖励倍数＝次数 × 小四梅倍率；奖池和预算不足会提前停止。每局入池 200 万分点即押分的 2%，不直接等于额外 RTP。</p><div class="rb-fields"><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbStartN">起手触发概率 <small>分子 / 分母</small></label><div class="rb-fraction"><input type="number" id="rbStartN" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="起手触发概率分子" /><span>/</span><input type="number" id="rbStartD" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="起手触发概率分母" /><output data-rb-pct></output></div></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbContinueN">窗口内续庄概率 <small>分子 / 分母</small></label><div class="rb-fraction"><input type="number" id="rbContinueN" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="窗口内续庄概率分子" /><span>/</span><input type="number" id="rbContinueD" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="窗口内续庄概率分母" /><output data-rb-pct></output></div></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbExpiredN">窗口外复燃概率 <small>分子 / 分母</small></label><div class="rb-fraction"><input type="number" id="rbExpiredN" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="窗口外复燃概率分子" /><span>/</span><input type="number" id="rbExpiredD" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="窗口外复燃概率分母" /><output data-rb-pct></output></div></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbSecondJokerN">补第二张鬼概率 <small>分子 / 分母</small></label><div class="rb-fraction"><input type="number" id="rbSecondJokerN" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="补第二张鬼概率分子" /><span>/</span><input type="number" id="rbSecondJokerD" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="补第二张鬼概率分母" /><output data-rb-pct></output></div></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbJokerFirstN">鬼排首位概率 <small>分子 / 分母</small></label><div class="rb-fraction"><input type="number" id="rbJokerFirstN" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="鬼排首位概率分子" /><span>/</span><input type="number" id="rbJokerFirstD" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" aria-label="鬼排首位概率分母" /><output data-rb-pct></output></div></div></div><div class="rb-options"><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbGuaranteeLast" /> 烧火末局保底触发</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbBlockHigher" /> 连庄期间屏蔽更高奖型</label></div></div></article>
    <div id="rbOther"><article class="rb-panel"><header class="rb-panel-title"><h3>过关 / 爆机彩金</h3><span class="rb-pill">比倍玩法规则</span></header><div class="rb-panel-body"><div class="rb-options"><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbPassOn" /> 启用过关彩金</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="rbExplodeOn" /> 启用爆机彩金</label></div><div class="rb-fields"><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbPassTarget">过关目标分</label><input type="number" id="rbPassTarget" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbPassBonus">过关彩金分</label><input type="number" id="rbPassBonus" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbExplodeTarget">爆机目标分</label><input type="number" id="rbExplodeTarget" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div><div class="rb-field"><label for="rbExplodeBonus">爆机彩金分</label><input type="number" id="rbExplodeBonus" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" /></div></div><p class="rb-mini-note">达到爆机目标后锁机，只能收分。两项开关独立保存。</p></div></article></div>
    <p class="rb-caption">全民赛跑的时段、名额、开关在「活动配置」中管理。</p>
    <div id="rabbitConfigStatus" class="rb-caption" role="status"></div>
</section>
<script>
window.RABBIT_CONFIG_URLS={get:'@Url.Action("GetRabbitConfig", "GameConfig", new { area = "Game" })'};
window.RABBIT_RULE_DEFAULTS=@Html.Raw(YYT.Web.Models.RabbitConfig.DefaultJson);
</script>
<script src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/app/game.rabbitconfig.js?v=" + YYT.Common.ConfigHelper.Get("WebVer"))"></script>
